  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to Strengthen Partnerships for Inclusion Resilience and Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farmers in Jubaland, Southwest, Hirshabelle, Galmudug, Puntland States and Banadir of Somalia, will improve rural livelihoods, by supporting climate-smart food production initiatives in communities connected to the schools and support youth and women farmers&#x2019; groups, and cooperatives to diversify income within local value chains. ASPIRE will support revolving funds, small start-up grants and equipment and supplies for income generation.</narrative>
  </description>
